  "notes": [
    "The earlier Alpha generic-numeral search did not prepare its adjustable numeral layer. It is superseded here by active-control and full-native trial parity checks.",
    "All 597 original cost headers were visually reviewed. Alpha Cyclopean Tomb has no printed cost; Alpha Orcish Artillery and Orcish Oriflamme print 1R. The other costs match.",
    "All 45 Alpha white printings were tested after the initial 10-name proposal. Calibration gain 0.002900 falls below the predeclared >0.003 gate; retain the baseline.",
    "Generic-number proposals are judged across mixed colored costs, not only the four artifact examples.",
    "Three Alpha frame-rejected scans remain excluded from ranked comparisons. The historical attempted circle on Alpha Cyclopean Tomb was an input error, not a scan failure.",
    "Beta Demonic Hordes is measured with a shared expanded search range. Red Elemental Blast remains a circle-estimator outlier: its header and cost were visually checked; do not alter its scan pose or renderer offset.",
    "The archived original spacing pass uses the narrower disc measurements. Its excluded perimeter measurements remain visible; no individual printing receives an offset from those diagnostics."
  ]
}
